CHAPTER.VERS:
Sow to yourselves in righteousness, reap according to kindness; break up your

          {+}
         fallow ground; for it is time to seek Yahweh, until he comes and rains righteousness on you

          {+}
        .

You

          {+}
         have plowed wickedness, you

          {+}
         have reaped iniquity; you

          {+}
         have eaten the fruit of lies; for you trusted in your way, in the multitude of your mighty men.

So Beth-el will do to you

          {+}
         because of your

          {+}
         great wickedness: at daybreak the king of Israel will be completely cut off.
